---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="PickLoot's affiliate and advertising disclosure."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last updated: August 14, 2026</p>

    <p>
      PickLoot displays advertising served by Google AdSense. We may also
      participate in affiliate marketing programs from time to time; when we
      do, purchases made through a clearly marked affiliate link may earn us
      a commission at no additional cost to you. Product links on this Site
      that are not part of an active affiliate program point to a plain
      product search or listing page and earn us nothing.
    </p>
    <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
    <p>
      Commissions never influence which products we choose to cover or how we
      describe them. We only recommend products we believe offer genuine value
      based on our research. Prices and availability referenced in our content
      are approximate at the time of writing and are subject to change on the
      retailer's site — always check the retailer's page for current pricing.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this disclosure, email
      <a href="mailto:hello@pickloot.com">hello@pickloot.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
